{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was a time when you were a coveted video game console toy that redefined entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are <strong>TRASH.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape an underground that's as beautifully nostalgic as it is suffocating.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on, one last adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>originally a winner of the Inbound Shovel Jam 2025, extended with more puzzles, new abilities, secrets, and a fully fleshed out world and story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious World!</strong>\u00a0Explore the whimsical, decaying ruins of 3 fictional N64-era platformer gems!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique 3D Puzzle Platformer Gameplay!\u00a0</strong>Express your abilities through a one button - one use collectable cartridge system. Use these to solve spatial puzzles, and overcome fresh platforming challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Relics!\u00a0</strong>Use abilities in creative ways to find secret areas and collect bygone treasure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfy Instinctual Cravings!</strong>\u00a0Roll around dirt as a little retro game-console robot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game You Can Finish In One Sitting!</strong>\u00a0Trash Bot respects your time. A complete experience that can be finished in one sitting!\u00a0<i>(depending on your proficiency with puzzle platformers)</i>. Completing all challenges and collecting all secrets will take much longer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/extras/34e6659966e21bf6d94e39024660d089.avif?t=1754664173\" width=200 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924990?t=1754664173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924990?t=1754664173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/aa4447a7fe92e27a359184c13b7295fcc7e71f07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754664173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/aa4447a7fe92e27a359184c13b7295fcc7e71f07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754664173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was a time when you were a coveted video game console toy that redefined entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are <strong>TRASH.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape an underground that's as beautifully nostalgic as it is suffocating.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on, one last adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>originally a winner of the Inbound Shovel Jam 2025, extended with more puzzles, new abilities, secrets, and a fully fleshed out world and story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious World!</strong>\u00a0Explore the whimsical, decaying ruins of 3 fictional N64-era platformer gems!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique 3D Puzzle Platformer Gameplay!\u00a0</strong>Express your abilities through a one button - one use collectable cartridge system. Use these to solve spatial puzzles, and overcome fresh platforming challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Relics!\u00a0</strong>Use abilities in creative ways to find secret areas and collect bygone treasure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfy Instinctual Cravings!</strong>\u00a0Roll around dirt as a little retro game-console robot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game You Can Finish In One Sitting!</strong>\u00a0Trash Bot respects your time. A complete experience that can be finished in one sitting!\u00a0<i>(depending on your proficiency with puzzle platformers)</i>. Completing all challenges and collecting all secrets will take much longer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/extras/34e6659966e21bf6d94e39024660d089.avif?t=1754664173\" width=200 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Jahju"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/f207cee988a9bcd9a5d065f11424a153821e89e2/header.jpg?t=1754664173","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924990/1630292796/eb5335da319d9e68876110ed90a983ae20da7e86/1754074532/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754664171","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924990/1630292796/eb5335da319d9e68876110ed90a983ae20da7e86/1754074532/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754664171","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/392